        "created_at": "2012-11-22T23:21:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Lol, I've been repeatedly forgetting to make a post about this issue for about two weeks now :P. Other forums I'm in give a small pop-up window containing a \"new PM\" notification when you access the forum's homepage, but also have a \"You have X new messages\" link at the top of the page. Another has the \"Private Message\" link change colour when you have a message waiting.</p><p>Anything which is noticeable from the forum homepage would be cool, really :).</p>",
