        "created_at": "2012-11-23T09:31:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ooh, something else I thought of - make user post-counts visible in the left-hand panel under their avatars. Just 'cause I like to randomly glance across at mine and go \"Hey wow, I've made X posts...damn didn't know I'd posted that often..\" :D. Also, it lets people make showy-off announcements when they hit numbers that are in any way significant (\"Woo 1000 posts!\"). And stuff. :D</p>",
