        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-26T02:27:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Did the search feature break? &nbsp;I searched for \"spiff accessories\" because I'd made an update to one of my files, and it said it couldn't find the topic. &nbsp;It couldn't find \"accessories\", \"ranger\", or anything else.</span></p><p><span>While we're on the subject, would it be possible to get my accessories topic stickied? &nbsp;It seems to be helpful to enough people, and that way they (and I) wouldn't have to go digging for it every time something changes.</span></p>",
