        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-13T11:10:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've had the unread posts feature behave strangely since the changeover. The forum select page will say there are unread posts or threads, but when I look at the forum, nothing is new. (or less than what the forum select page told me).</p><p>Mostly I'm browsing on an iPad 2 running iOS 5. I also use pc's, with either Opera, Firefox, or Chrome, but I can't recall if I've seen the problem on any of those.</p>",
