        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-13T23:32:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"ax0r\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ax0r:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I've had the unread posts feature behave strangely since the changeover. The forum select page will say there are unread posts or threads, but when I look at the forum, nothing is new. (or less than what the forum select page told me).Mostly I'm browsing on an iPad 2 running iOS 5. I also use pc's, with either Opera, Firefox, or Chrome, but I can't recall if I've seen the problem on any of those.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Which changeover? If you mean going back a few months, I used to have that problem and it turned out that some older posts had been marked as new and I had to dig through and find them. Then it went away. I haven't seen that since the changeover just a few days ago.</p>",
