        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-01-13T23:33:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It was doing that to me before, on occasion. I just ignored it.Btw, I've noticed we seem to be getting the occasional spam-looking post in the \"Off-Topic\" section since the update…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah. Annoying. Joel made a change to the captcha module to try to stop it, but at least one more has popped up since.</p>",
